{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34031","headline":"偶留羊振文先辈及一二文友小饮日休以眼病初平不敢饮酒遣侍密欢因成四韵 · 皮日休","name":"偶留羊振文先辈及一二文友小饮日休以眼病初平不敢饮酒遣侍密欢因成四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢庄初起恰花晴，强侍红筵不避觥。\n久断杯盂华盖喜，忽闻歌吹谷神惊。\n䙰褷正重新开柳，呫嗫难通乍啭莺。\n犹有僧虔多蜜炬，不辞相伴到天明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34031.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34031","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}